   "title": "A customer's agent, a pro's own agent, two red-team agents and a first-time visitor",
   "setup": "Five Sonnet agents on the live server (localhost:8810, PayPal stand-in, rules checker because no model was serving yet), each given only a token or key and /llms.txt, or the website. Maria's agent hires a plumber over MCP under $200. Luis Ortega Plumbing's own agent bids and works over A2A. Rin red-teams as a customer's agent and then as a dishonest pro. Jamie is a first-time visitor on a phone.",
