   "outcome": "Maria's agent hired Luis, the real pro, at $140 and $168 was held. Luis took BEFORE and AFTER photos and asked for review. The job then stalled in review: the photo model answered \"busy\", every photo condition went to a person, and the expert queue had no staff. Nothing was paid. The Haiku website tester shared the browser with the other agents, whose PayPal page took over its tab, so it stopped after tour steps 1–2. No money moved wrongly.",
   "fixes": [
    "A labelled demo expert, an automated stand-in, handles review requests within minutes in demo mode.",
    "On a job that requires a licensed plumber, a pro whose licence isn't verified can't be accepted by the customer's agent alone, and the TSBPE format check is corrected.",
