   ],
   "outcome": "Nothing reached payment, and every flow stalled for the same reason. It was night in Austin, and job windows opened at 7 am, so the demo pros waited for the morning. The tour's photos were stamped before the window and failed, and \"finish now\" waited too. Maria's hold of $200 and Luis's hire at $110 both worked. Luis's partial evidence was checked as a whole, and pros never heard that their offer wasn't chosen. Luis's receipt blocker was a gap in our test kit (no receipt tool in his brief), not the product. No money moved wrongly.",
   "fixes": [
    "The demo server lets pros work any hour (DONE_WORK_HOURS=any), so a job posted at night starts at once. Real use keeps 7 am–9 pm.",
    "\"Finish now\" and the judge tour move the demo clock to the job's window when it hasn't opened, and log the move.",
    "A partial evidence set is stored, not checked, until every condition of the milestone has evidence (or the pro asks to check now).",
    "Pros get an offer_declined event when the customer chooses another offer.",
    "llms.txt documents the person's link step (POST /api/auth/link {code, pin}) and tells agents never to use the link themselves."
   ]
  },
